<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Ai_agent on Best of AI</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tags/ai_agent/</link><description>Recent content in Ai_agent on Best of AI</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-US</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://bestofai.io/tags/ai_agent/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>11x</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/11x-ai/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/11x-ai/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Azure AI Foundry</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/azure-ai-foundry/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/azure-ai-foundry/</guid><description/></item><item><title>BabyAGI</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/babyagi/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/babyagi/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Claude Cowork</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/claude-cowork/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/claude-cowork/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Cowork takes the agent approach behind Claude Code and puts it in a regular app window. Instead of typing commands, you describe a job such as sorting a folder of receipts, turning notes into a report, or building a spreadsheet from several PDFs. Claude plans the steps, works on the files you have shared with it, and reports back when it is done.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It is aimed at office work more than software projects. You choose which folders it can see, so it only touches what you hand over. It suits repetitive jobs where you would otherwise copy and paste between documents all afternoon.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Gemini Spark</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/gemini-spark/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/gemini-spark/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Spark runs in the background and handles longer jobs, such as pulling together information from your inbox and documents or following up on a task over several days. Google says it works with Gmail and Docs first, and that outside tools will connect through MCP later.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At launch it was limited to US subscribers on the Google AI Ultra plan. Android is expected to show an agent&amp;rsquo;s progress at the top of the screen later in the year.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>LangGraph</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/langgraph/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/langgraph/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Microsoft Copilot Studio</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/microsoft-copilot-studio/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/microsoft-copilot-studio/</guid><description/></item><item><title>SuperAGI</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/superagi/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/superagi/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Claude Duet</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/claude-duet/</link><pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/claude-duet/</guid><description/></item><item><title>OpenAI Dots</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/openai-dots/</link><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/openai-dots/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Grok Bot</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/grok-bot/</link><pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/grok-bot/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Sider Omni Sidebar</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/sider-omni-sidebar/</link><pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/sider-omni-sidebar/</guid><description/></item><item><title>MagiCrew</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/magicrew/</link><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/magicrew/</guid><description/></item><item><title>ChatGPT Atlas</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/chatgpt-atlas/</link><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/chatgpt-atlas/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Viktor</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/viktor-ai/</link><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/viktor-ai/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Viktor is an AI agent from Zeta Labs that lives inside Slack and Microsoft Teams instead of a standalone interface. It connects to a company&amp;rsquo;s existing tools, learns the patterns of how a team works over time, and steps in with suggestions or completed work such as campaign drafts, internal apps, and reports, without waiting for someone to open a separate app.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zeta Labs, the team behind the earlier AI email assistant Jace, launched Viktor on Slack first and expanded it to Microsoft Teams in mid-2026. The company says tens of thousands of teams have adopted it, and it has raised a $75 million Series A led by Accel. Viktor targets teams that want an AI agent that acts inside the channels where work already happens rather than one more tool to switch into.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Comet</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/perplexity-comet/</link><pubDate>Wed, 29 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/perplexity-comet/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Genspark</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/genspark/</link><pubDate>Wed, 29 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/genspark/</guid><description/></item><item><title>OpenAI Presence</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/openai-presence/</link><pubDate>Wed, 22 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/openai-presence/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Baidu Qianfan</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/baidu-qianfan/</link><pubDate>Fri, 17 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/baidu-qianfan/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Cohere North</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/cohere-north/</link><pubDate>Fri, 17 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/cohere-north/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Palantir AIP</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/palantir-aip/</link><pubDate>Fri, 17 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/palantir-aip/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Tencent Cloud ADP</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/tencent-cloud-adp/</link><pubDate>Fri, 17 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/tencent-cloud-adp/</guid><description/></item><item><title>ChatGPT Work</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/chatgpt-work/</link><pu